C:© 1992 Ben Paley
N:The rhythm is inspired by Armenian music, specifically the oud of John Bilezikjian, whose 1994
N:album "Music of the Armenian Diaspora" has been a favourite of since its release. The rhythmic
N:pattern goes 3-2-2-3 | 3-2-2-3 | 3-2-2-3 | 3-3-2-2 \u2014 Note that the last bar in the pattern
N:is different.
N:I played it with Tab Hunter on our 1999 album "dolor ipse". You can purchase a download from my
N:Bandcamp page: benpaley-fiddle.bandcamp.com
